App "citi_banking_adk" can transfer between agents but has no context_cache_config. Every transfer swaps the system instruction and the tool set, so the request prefix changes and the whole prompt is re-sent uncached after each transfer. Set context_cache_config on the app to give each agent its own cache.
{
  "mid_office_planning": [
    {
      "agent": "user_proxy_agent",
      "event": "transfer",
      "to": "mid_office_router"
    },
    {
      "agent": "mid_office_router",
      "event": "transfer",
      "to": "mid_office_planning_workflow"
    },
    {
      "agent": "data_analysis_agent",
      "event": "tool_call",
      "tool": "get_operations_snapshot",
      "args": {
        "date": "2026-04-21"
      }
